# /etc/ai-trading/paper-fleet.env - OPTIONAL environment of the paper fleet (docs/runbooks/PAPER_FLEET.md).
# The paper fleet needs NO secrets: no OKX keys, no Anthropic key, no Telegram token.
# Never put a secret here, and never point the service at the repository .env.

# Where the fleet keeps its journals, reports, state and its own public-data copy
# (default logs/paper_fleet inside the checkout). If you change it, change
# ReadWritePaths in paper-fleet.service to the same folder.
#PAPER_FLEET_DIR=/path/to/ai-trading-model/logs/paper_fleet

# The research data lake the fleet copies history from on its first start (read
# only; default data/lake). Without one it downloads the history from OKX.
#DATA_LAKE_DIR=/path/to/ai-trading-model/data/lake

# Optional: PAPER_FLEET_LOG_LEVEL=WARNING
